1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,800
So instead of changing my workflow, I built my own Python program.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:08,200
It takes a video and an SRT file and automatically creates captioned videos.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:11,500
And another advantage of this is that you can change the language

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,400
while speaking and it will detect it

5
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,500
because this SRT file was generated by Gen AI.

6
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,800
It has pop-up animation and word-by-word highlights.

7
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:24,200
And yeah, this project took many hours of debugging and optimization,

8
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:27,500
but it solved a real problem in my content workflow. Thank you.